### The team's audit trail (OWNER only), newest first, cursor paging.

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@ownerToken = paste-access-token-of-an-owner
@team = paste-team-id

### First page
# @name page
GET {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/audit-events?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

###
@cursor = {{page.response.body.nextCursor}}

### Next page: pass nextCursor back as `after` (an opaque token; a made-up one is a 400)
GET {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/audit-events?limit=20&after={{cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
